-download) in YouTube Download. Nice","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"GUI for YT-DL with single-click installer."}]},{"markdown":"Starred [EverythingToolbar](/system-tools#system-tweaks) in System Tweaks.","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"Adds lots of features to Windows toolbar."}]},{"markdown":"Starred [DeepL](/text-tools#translators) in Translators. People feel this","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"gives some of the best results."}]},{"markdown":"Starred [Magpie](/gaming#optimization-tools) in Gaming","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"Optimization. Enable AMD FSR on any game or device."}]},{"markdown":"Starred [TrollStore](/mobile#ios-apps) in iOS Apps. Permanently","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"install non-App Store iOS apps w/o PC, paid dev account or being jailbroken."}]},{"markdown":"Starred [SmartTube](/video#smart-tv-firestick) in Smart TV /","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"Firestick. Ad-free YouTube app. Previously called SmartTubeNext."}]}]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"things-removed","markdown":"Things Removed"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"markdown":"Removed NovaAI as they've","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"[decided to shut down](https://www.reddit.com/r/Piracy/comments/17pzrzj/nova_oss_the_api_that_provided_free_gpt4_and/)."}]},{"markdown":"Removed both LocalCDN and Decentraleyes as they're redundant with","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"[Total Cookie Protection](https://blog.privacyguides.org/2021/12/01/firefox-privacy-2021-update/#localcdn-and-decentraleyes) enabled."}]},{"markdown":"Replaced all CurseForge links with Modrinth as people feel CurseForge","children":[{"kind":"paragraph","markdown":"[doesn't cooperate](https://youtu.be/Vhdwz5apiQQ?si=xgzkQFa1S7hZNa5-) with their user-base well."}]},{"markdown":"Unstarred 12ft.io as it can no longer bypass non-JavaScript based paywalls.","children":[]},{"markdown":"Removed File